---
to: "release/FINAL_STATUS.md"
sparql:
  meta: |
    PREFIX post: <https://mfact.dev/postrelease#>
    SELECT ?releaseId ?coreReleaseHash ?coreProven ?coreTotalDecls ?statedCount
           ?renderedCommit ?coreTag ?tagCommit ?tagGate ?packetHash ?arxivStatus
           ?arxivDetail ?replayStatus ?docsLane ?crownStatus ?publication
    WHERE { ?m a post:MetaNode ; post:releaseId ?releaseId ;
      post:coreReleaseHash ?coreReleaseHash ; post:coreProven ?coreProven ;
      post:coreTotalDecls ?coreTotalDecls ; post:statedCount ?statedCount ;
      post:renderedCommit ?renderedCommit ; post:coreTag ?coreTag ;
      post:tagCommit ?tagCommit ; post:tagGate ?tagGate ;
      post:packetHash ?packetHash ; post:arxivStatus ?arxivStatus ;
      post:arxivDetail ?arxivDetail ; post:replayStatus ?replayStatus ;
      post:docsLane ?docsLane ; post:crownStatus ?crownStatus ;
      post:publication ?publication . }
  packets: |
    PREFIX post: <https://mfact.dev/postrelease#>
    SELECT ?packetId ?packetStatus ?publication
    WHERE { ?p a post:Packet ; post:packetId ?packetId ;
      post:packetStatus ?packetStatus ; post:publication ?publication . }
    ORDER BY ?packetId
  obligations: |
    PREFIX post: <https://mfact.dev/postrelease#>
    SELECT ?oblName ?oblStatus ?oblNote
    WHERE { ?o a post:Obligation ; post:oblOrder ?ord ; post:oblName ?oblName ;
      post:oblStatus ?oblStatus ; post:oblNote ?oblNote . }
    ORDER BY ?ord
force: true
skip_empty: true
---
# FINAL STATUS — {% for m in meta %}{{ m.releaseId }}{% endfor %}

Rendered view over standing (post-release-pack). Nothing here is asserted
in prose: every value is projected from receipts. Layered standing — the
core release, the publication packet, and the auxiliary lanes are three
different identities and must not be flattened into one verdict.

## Core certified release (frozen)

```
{% for m in meta %}CORE_RELEASE=ALIVE
CORE_RELEASE_HASH={{ m.coreReleaseHash }}
CORE_PROVEN={{ m.coreProven }}
CORE_TOTAL_DECLS={{ m.coreTotalDecls }}
CORE_STATED={{ m.statedCount }}
RENDERED_COMMIT={{ m.renderedCommit }}
TAG_EXPECTED={{ m.coreTag }}
TAG_COMMIT={{ m.tagCommit }}
RENDERED_COMMIT_IS_ANCESTOR_OF_TAG={{ m.tagGate }}
{% endfor %}```

## Publication packet (separate identity; never self-actuated)

```
{% for m in meta %}POST_RELEASE_PACKET_HASH={{ m.packetHash }}
PUBLICATION_ACTUATION={{ m.publication }}
ARXIV_PACKET={{ m.arxivStatus }}
{% endfor %}{% for p in packets %}{{ p.packetId | upper }}_PACKET={{ p.packetStatus }}
{% endfor %}```

{% for m in meta %}arXiv gate: {{ m.arxivDetail }}.{% endfor %}
Actuation packets whose requirements are all met are ALIVE; publication
itself remains the user's action in every case.

